.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-bake 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-bake \- Bake a release\*(Aqs tag and archive digests into install.lock and install.sh, as one commit on its release head
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release bake\fR [\fB\-\-sha\fR] [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-write\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItag\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bake a release\*(Aqs tag and archive digests into install.lock and install.sh, as one commit on its release head
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sha\fR \fI<sha>\fR
The release head the bake is committed onto; required unless \-\-write\-only
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fI<branch>\fR
The release branch moved to the bake commit; required unless \-\-write\-only
.TP
\fB\-\-write\-only\fR
Write install.lock and install.sh to the working tree and commit nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItag\fR>
The release\*(Aqs tag
